      "content": "<h3>HashSet versus LinkedHashSet versus TreeSet: the map behind each</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;\">\n<tr><th style=\"text-align:left;\"></th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">HashSet</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">LinkedHashSet</th><th style=\"text-align:left;\">TreeSet</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Backing map</td><td><code>HashMap</code></td><td><code>LinkedHashMap</code></td><td><code>TreeMap</code> (via NavigableMap)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Order</td><td>None</td><td>Insertion</td><td>Sorted</td></tr>\n<tr><td>add / contains / remove</td><td>O(1)</td><td>O(1)</td><td>O(log n)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Duplicate test</td><td>hashCode + equals</td><td>hashCode + equals</td><td>compareTo / Comparator</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Null element</td><td>One</td><td>One</td><td>No (natural order)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Extra memory per element</td><td>Node</td><td>Node + 2 links</td><td>Tree node (larger)</td></tr>\n</table>"
